star drifting away. that's why the little stars is the homeland of this continent and to learn all that one will expand your learning how you should live in this country and look firstly you must learn all these archives in the law the skin name the land the ceremony and the language Thank you. You have to understand the immune"}, {"start": "01:07:47", "end": "01:08:38", "text": "Your country will know you. Satsang with Mooji"}, {"start": "04:12:41", "end": "04:13:06", "text": ""}, {"start": "04:53:17", "end": "04:53:55", "text": "Satsang with Mooji flicking their finger like that so they get to expand the light going this way horizontally"}, {"start": "04:54:24", "end": "04:55:11", "text": "First, he had to grow like a tree, straight up. That means, yeah, everything is born unto you. Everything around you, yeah, gonna be you. Embrace them while you can. Learn about them, because they'll guide you how you should live, because you're gonna have to adapt to this harsh country and enjoy its richness, I guess, with that knowledge. Because if you don't, yeah, your birch ride is stripped from you and your life falls short. It's a really hard country out here."}, {"start": "04:56:52", "end": "04:57:38", "text": "But learning through these knowledges through the initiation ceremony of this place here, that's what I mean by negative and positive consequences of the law. It makes or breaks you. Haka and Albert, it's just the way the country is built. Or created, that's all."}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:00:34"}, "track": {"title": "I Want C & B to Fix My Car", "artists": [{"name": "Boof"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:01:00"}, "track": {"title": "Show Me Love", "artists": [{"name": "Robin S."}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:03:00"}, "track": {"title": "Sound Check One", "artists": [{"name": "Pacho & Pepo"}]}, "i